  "changes": [
    "Partition each authorized history once, retaining global duplicate winners and every existing day calculation.",
    "Resolve the unchanged report authorization boundary once per Finance read.",
    "One active client read per component and one reread after writes; focus during active reads is coalesced.",
    "No hidden Doctor answer reads on question list; stop/cancel on question or scope changes.",
    "15-second deadline includes response JSON; cancel transport and clear loading so user can retry."
  ],
